Reviewing 24H Hotspots - Market Overview

1. Market: #比特币  rose above 68,000 USDT, reported at 68,009.26, daily +1.52%

2. Trump announced an additional "10% global tariff" on all countries, stating that existing tariffs remain in effect; experts say the industry's tariff risks will persist in the long term;

3. The controversy over "tariff refunds/returns" escalates: Trump claims it could drag on for 5 years; Besant states the levied amount could be closer to 130 billion USD; Illinois demands 8.6 billion USD;

4. WSJ: #OpenAI  had previously flagged violent descriptions related to the Canadian shooting suspect internally but did not report to law enforcement;

5. ProShares' "stablecoin-ready" ETF achieved a record trading volume of 17 billion USD on its first day;

6. BNP Paribas chooses Ethereum to advance its new money market fund tokenization pilot;

7. Macroeconomics: The U.S. December goods trade deficit widened to -70.3 billion USD; the full-year 2025 deficit is projected at -901.5 billion USD, the third largest since 1960;

8. #ETH  Roadmap: FOCIL is officially included in the upgrade roadmap, with Vitalik stating that the goal is to have an Ethereum that embodies "cypherpunk principles and is not ugly."
